msgid ""
"This program has encountered an unexpected problem. This is probably because "
"of a recent server update, a bug in this program, or in one of the plugins. "
"We apologize for this problem. You may get support from IRC or the forums.\n"
"\n"
"A detailed error report has been saved to errors.txt. Before posting a bug "
"report, please try out the latest release GIT version first. If you are "
"already using the latest release GIT version, search the forums first to see "
"if your problem had already been solved, or has already been reported. If "
"you truly believe you have encountered a bug in the program, please include "
"the contents of the errors.txt in your bug report (https://github.com/"
"openkore/openkore/issues), or we may not be able to help you!\n"
"\n"
"The error message is:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"本程式遇到了意外問題。這可能是由於近期伺服器更新、本程式錯誤或其中一個擴充套"
"件中的錯誤所致。我們對這個問題表示歉意。您可以透過 IRC 或論壇獲得支援。\n"
"\n"
"詳細錯誤報告已儲存至 errors.txt。在提交錯誤報告前，請先嘗試使用最新的 GIT 版"
"本。如果您已經使用最新的 GIT 版本，請先搜尋論壇，看看您的問題是否已解決或已報"
"告。如果您確實認為程式中存在錯誤，請將 errors.txt 的內容包含在錯誤報告中 "
"(https://github.com/openkore/openkore/issues)，否則我們可能無法協助您！\n"
"\n"
"錯誤訊息為：\n"
"%s"

